message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "QIK-VRT: Wissenschaftlicher Faktenbau im Kausalitäts-Mesh"
type: article
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-01
authors:
  - family-names: Lohmann
    given-names: Ingolf
abstract: >-
  An additive, machine-checkable protocol and Lean formalization for
  classifying, preserving and merging bounded scientific claims in QIK-VRT
  repositories. The work proves finite append-only and merge properties,
  evidence-closure monotonicity, conflict preservation and proposal-only
  effect separation while explicitly leaving universal truth, global novelty,
  complete natural-language formalization and physical quantum or
  retrocausal bridges unresolved.
keywords:
  - QIK-VRT
  - scientific claims
  - formal verification
  - Lean
  - provenance
  - causality mirror
  - knowledge graph
  - digital twins
  - epistemic status
  - effect authorization
